🇷🇺 🇺🇦 🔹Key points from the new briefing by the Russian Ministry of Defense:

▪️ The Russian Armed Forces struck ammunition depots, as well as storage and production sites for robotic complexes of the Ukrainian Armed Forces, over the past 24 hours;

▪️ Russian air defense systems shot down 4 long-range “Neptune” missiles and 903 fixed-wing Ukrainian Armed Forces drones over the past 24 hours;

▪️ Ukrainian Armed Forces units lost approximately 1,155 personnel over the past 24 hours in the areas of responsibility of all Russian Armed Forces groupings.

